   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Imperfective: simultaneity or process",
     "texto": [
      "The imperfective gerund usually indicates a simultaneous action: читая статью, он делал заметки («while reading the article, he took notes»). It is also used for processes or habits: возвращаясь домой («on the way home»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Perfective: a completed earlier action",
     "texto": [
      "The perfective gerund usually expresses an action that finished before the main one: прочитав статью, он написал отзыв («after reading the article, he wrote a review»). Compare читать → читая with прочитать → прочитав."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The same subject",
     "texto": [
      "The implicit subject of the gerund must be the subject of the main clause: Прочитав отчёт, эксперт подготовил выводы («After reading the report, the expert drew up conclusions»). It is normally separated by a comma. Avoid it if the secondary action is carried out by another person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
